// Discard position for the inner kinds dropDiscardedOptional already dispatches.
// The six it has no arm for (nested, tuple, array, enum, task, structural) leak
// identically for a plain CALL and are tracked separately as T2209 — they are
// deliberately not parked here as known leaks.

